        <p>Mr. /Tucker is once more in the ranks of vigorous workers,and it is to men who crave for their former activity that his exparience is addressed. Dr. Williams' Pink Pills supply new rich blood to impoverished veins 'enable the system to throw off disease,und stay increas- ing weakness. They also fortify the nerves, and have cured in men and women Anremui, Indigestion. Eczema and skin diseases. Bile, Rheumatism. Sciatica, Paralysis, Locomutor Ataxy, St. Vitus' Dance, and the ailments of ladies.ilut only the genuine pills cure—those labelled Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People. Refuse sib- stitutes offered at some shops. If in doubt send to Dr. Williams' Medicine Company, Holborn-viaduct, London. enclosing 2s. 9d, for one box, and 13s. 91 for six boxes.</p>
