        <p>, I FLETCHER RUSSELL V. 11YLANDs No. 2.—Played cn the green of the King and Queen on Saturday. Score: FLETCHEWS. Rvidesp's. J. W. Evens l5 A. Thornley 5 J. 13roadhurst E. Bailey T. Bridge J. Nodeu W. Ashall l5 A. Jolley F'. Ball T. Hackett J. Massey, jun. F. Heesom , 9 W. Cottam l5 E. Shaw l5 Joe Ashton '.l. Massey, sen.</p>
