        <p>SQUADRON FLAG. RACE :—(Upper) Winning Team, Form VII: Team, Lilian Wright, E. J. Mee, Kathleen Cole, R. C. Parkinson, Frances Corney, P. F. Boardman. (Lower) Winning Team, Form IV: Team, M. Collin, C. Price, H. Waring, S. Morton, W. Brock, R. Chadwick SKIPPING MILL-A-GATE:—(Upper), 1, Annie Harter (Form VII.) ; 2, Lilian Wright (Form VII.); 3, F. Waring (Ist. year). (Lower),l, A. Jackson (Form IV.); 2,11. Waring (Form IV); 3 N. Kershaw (Form IV.) 100 YARDS FLIT RACE:—Boys (Unner), 0. Sinclair (Schol) 1 yard, and E. J. Mee (Form VI), scratch, dead heat; 3 W. C. Hardily, (Form VI.), 2 yards. (Lower), 1 I J. Broadhurst (Form III.), scratch; 2. R, Chadwick (Form TV.), 2 yards: 3, C. Price (Form IV.), 1 yard. Girls, (Upper), 1. A. Baker (Form V.), 5 yards; 2. L Wright (Form VII.), 1 yard; 3, M. Jolley (Form VIA I 2 yards. (Lower). 1, J. Sexton (Form 3). 3 yards ; 2 IW. Brock (Form IV.), 3 yards; 3, H. Gee (Form IV.) I 8 yards. SKIPPING RACE : —Girls (Upper). 1, Bessie England I(Form V.), 4 yards; 2. L. Wright (Form VII.), 2 yards. 13„ F. Corney (Form VII.) 3 yards; (Lower), 1, J. Sexton (Form III.), 3 Tards ; 2, A. Jackson (Form IV.) 5 I yards; 3, Hilda Gee (Form IV). 8 yards. BICYCLE RACE:—Boys (Upper), 1, J. Brown (Form ; 2. W. E. R. Collins (Ist year) ; 3; W. C. Harding (Form VI.) SLow BICYCLE RACE :—Girls (Upper). 1. A. Baker (Form V.): 2, K. Isherwood (Form V.); 3, L. Fawcett (Form V.) (Lower) 1, A. Jackson (Form IV.); 2, F. Lowe (Form IV.) LON•G JUMP :—Boys (Upper), 1, W. Houghton (Form V.), 13ft. 9in. ; 2, R. C. Parkinson (Form VII.), 12ft. Sins.•, 3,0. Sinclair (Bohol), 12ft. 71ns. (Lower). 1, J. Broadhurst (Form III.) lift. Sins.; 2, R. Chadwick (Form IV.), 10ft. 10ins.: 3, F. Newbold (Form IV.), Oft. Sins. HIGH JUMP :—Boys (Upper), 1, W. Houghton (Form V.), 4ft. 2ins. : 2, 0. Sinclair (Schol.), 4ft. lin.; 3, E. J. Mee(Form VII.) and W. E. R. Collins (Ist year), 3ft. Sins. (Lower), I, .1. Broadhurst (Form III.), 4ft.; 2, J. Saunders (Form I.), Mt. Gin