        <p>LATCHFORD BAPTIST V. PRAIBERTON Sr. CUTHBERT'S —At Latchford on Saturday. Pemberton batted first. and made 71, to which the home team replied with 61. For Latchford Cliffe batted well for his 22, whilst the bowlinu honours went to J. Callon, who had the splendid analysis of six wickets for eight runs.</p>
